;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >2<font face="宋体" >、主导完成面辅料的选择，确定工作，分配新品设计、开发任务，</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >3<font face="宋体" >、准确把握产品风格、整合每季的全盘产品 ，组织每年春夏，秋冬两季的订货会。 画册的拍摄和企划</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >4<font face="宋体" >、为品牌营销推广部门提供产品明确的市场定位，流行风格，搭配方案、及卖点说明资料</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >5<font face="宋体" >、组建产品设计团队，协调人员关系，并拟定人才梯队培养计划，以及人员的培训、考核及客户维护</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:S