pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt ;border-left:none;border-right:none;border-top:none;border-bottom:none;background:rgb(255,255,255);" ><p class=MsoNormal  style="line-height:15.0000pt;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >前三年负责全系列产品的开发，后一年主要负责梭织类产品、正装类，配饰类、辅料的开发设计</span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >开发设计的主要工作和流程如下：</span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >1<font face="宋体" >、上季节市场销售的分析，市场调研与预测（本品牌的调研和竞争品牌的调研）</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >2<font face="宋体" >、协助设计总监进行开发计划的制定。 </font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >3<font face="宋体" >、根据流行趋势选择面辅料；设计款式 </font><font face="STSong-Light" >(</font><font face="宋体" >如去工厂选样，可做现场修改以符合本品牌的风格） </font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >4<font face="宋体" >、产品的初选，订货会的企划，产品的搭配介绍，包括画册的拍摄和企划</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >5<font face="宋体" >、生产过程中，协助跟单进行产品的质量控制和产前样的确认</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >6<font face="宋体" >、产品的上市阶段配合销售根据需要做一些企划设计 </font></span><span style="font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr></table><p class=MsoNormal ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><table class=39  border=1  cellspacing=0  style="border-collapse:collapse;width:523.3500pt;margin-le